<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"cs-inner-lead"} --><p class="cs-inner-lead">Silicon Geek Project Help is a <strong>learning-first guidance service</strong>. We help you choose, understand, design, debug and explain an electronics project. We do not become a hidden substitute for the student and we do not sell copied work for direct academic submission.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:group {"className":"cs-callout cs-callout--tip"} --><div class="wp-block-group cs-callout cs-callout--tip"><!-- wp:heading {"level":3} --><h3 class="wp-block-heading">Our simple promise</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Good help leaves you more capable than before. After guidance, you should be able to explain your block diagram, major components, circuit/code flow, testing method, limitations and possible viva answers in your own words.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class="wp-block-heading">1. Who provides the service?</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->
